  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Pacific Air Connectivity Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment is Australia&#x2019;s support provided through the Pacific Flights Program in response to the COVID-19 pandemic. This program seeks to facilitate regular commercial flights to mitigate the economic and humanitarian impacts of COVID-19. It includes the transport of essential supplies, vaccines, and the movement of people including healthcare workers.</narrative>
  </description>
